  "title": "Air Fryer Pizza-Stuffed Chicken Breasts",
  "description": "This recipe for air-fryer pizza-stuffed chicken breasts fills them with pizza toppings like mozzarella, pepperoni, and sauce. You won&#39;t miss the crust.",
  "authors": [
    "thedailygourmet"
